    "Documenting store transformations and fixture builds as a regular content series",
    "Showing deliveries for prominent retail brands as visible proof of capability",
    "Keeping both profiles active through a planned editorial calendar",
    "Writing for commercial decision-makers rather than general consumers",
    "Responding quickly to messages and comments and passing on qualified leads"
