    {
      title: "Client work shown as credibility",
      paragraphs: [
        "Posts that spotlight deliveries for well-known commercial retail brands act as a trust signal. A buyer who sees a familiar brand's store done well understands the standard of work without being told."
      ]
    },
    {
      title: "A calendar that keeps the pages active",
      paragraphs: [
        "Posting follows a planned calendar across Instagram and Facebook, so the profiles stay consistent in the gaps between projects. A steady presence tells a visitor that the business is busy and reliable."
      ]
    },
    {
      title: "Instagram for visuals, Facebook for detail",
      paragraphs: [
        "Instagram carries the strongest images of finished fixtures. Facebook suits fuller descriptions and business details that commercial buyers often check. Both profiles carry the same company name, Kochi address, and contact details."
      ]
    },
    {
      title: "Enquiries handled, not just received",
      paragraphs: [
        "Direct messages and comments are answered promptly, and genuine business enquiries are identified and passed to the sales team. This turns attention on the posts into conversations about real requirements."
      ]
    },
    {
      title: "Messaging kept to Kerala and to business buyers",
      paragraphs: [
        "The company delivers and installs across Kerala, so profile and post wording reflects that service area. The tone is professional and specific, written for people deciding on store fixtures rather than casual followers."
      ]
    }
  ],

  deliverables: [
    {
      title: "A project showcase content series",
      description: "Store transformations and fixture builds documented and published as a curated visual portfolio."
    },
    {
      title: "Brand credibility content",
      description: "Posts highlighting deliveries for prominent commercial retail brands."
    },
    {
      title: "A multi-channel editorial calendar",
      description: "Planned, consistent posting across Instagram and Facebook."
    },
    {
      title: "Enquiry and community handling",
      description: "Prompt replies to messages and comments, with genuine leads identified and passed on."
    },
    {
      title: "Aligned business details",
      description: "The same company name, address, and contact details across both profiles and the website."
    },
    {
      title: "B2B-focused messaging",
      description: "Copy written for brand managers and store owners across Kerala."
    }
  ],

  whyMattersHeading: "Why This Structure Matters",
  whyMattersParagraphs: [
    "Business buyers rarely commit to a supplier on a single contact. They look at the company's work, check who else it has served, and see whether the business looks active. A social profile that shows real finished projects and recognisable client work answers those questions without a sales call.",
